{"3914860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Moss: The Forgotten Relic ","steam_appid":3914860,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4892580],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey through the pages of a living fable.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moss: The Forgotten Relic<\/i> is an emotional and atmospheric adventure set in the pages of a living storybook, brimming with myth and ancient magic. Guide a tiny but determined hero on a heartfelt journey of challenge, courage, and connection. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Traverse a fallen kingdom, solve environmental puzzles woven into the landscape, and embark on a timeless adventure…<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moss: The Forgotten Relic <\/i>unites the beloved and critically-acclaimed Moss and Moss: Book II into a definitive singular adventure, beautifully enhanced and reimagined for its debut on PC. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/0efe0a46433854af0790680f6d7e4015.poster.avif?t=1788539047\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/0efe0a46433854af0790680f6d7e4015.webm?t=1788539047\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/0efe0a46433854af0790680f6d7e4015.mp4?t=1788539047\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fallen Kingdom<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a mythic land marked by the ruins of a ancient realm slowly being reclaimed by an enduring and untamed nature.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide an Unlikely Hero <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a powerful bond with Quill, a small and courageous mouse who looks to you for guidance, protection, and trust at every step of her journey.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a Timeless Tale<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden secrets, navigate puzzling places, and confront arcane forces in an intimate and epic fable inspired by classic fantasy adventures. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optional Local Co-Op<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together as Quill and the Reader, each using a separate controller<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/c049a68b919fbb1093a9706d5567cab6.poster.avif?t=1788539047\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/c049a68b919fbb1093a9706d5567cab6.webm?t=1788539047\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/c049a68b919fbb1093a9706d5567cab6.mp4?t=1788539047\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features <\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fallen kingdom slowly reclaimed by nature<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a tiny hero through mysterious places and towering dangers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve handcrafted, diorama-like environmental puzzles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden secrets and surprises off the beaten path<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face arcane threats with optional “skip combat” accessibility<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the epic and heartfelt tale of a hero who needs you<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtfully designed and lovingly crafted by a small team<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critically acclaimed with over 160 awards and nominations <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchestral soundtrack by acclaimed composer Jason Graves<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reimagined as the Definitive Adventure <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moss: The Forgotten Relic<\/i> brings <i>Moss <\/i>and <i>Moss: Book II<\/i> together as one complete, enhanced experience debuting on PC first time. New features include: <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 2 beloved and critically acclaimed experiences as one <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Visuals and Performance<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Handcrafted Cutscenes and Smart Follow Camera<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Twilight Garden DLC included <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Accessibility Option “Skip Combat”<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey through the pages of a living fable.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moss: The Forgotten Relic<\/i> is an emotional and atmospheric adventure set in the pages of a living storybook, brimming with myth and ancient magic. Guide a tiny but determined hero on a heartfelt journey of challenge, courage, and connection. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Traverse a fallen kingdom, solve environmental puzzles woven into the landscape, and embark on a timeless adventure…<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moss: The Forgotten Relic <\/i>unites the beloved and critically-acclaimed Moss and Moss: Book II into a definitive singular adventure, beautifully enhanced and reimagined for its debut on PC. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><