cab6.webm?t=1788539047\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3914860\/extras\/c049a68b919fbb1093a9706d5567cab6.mp4?t=1788539047\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features <\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fallen kingdom slowly reclaimed by nature<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a tiny hero through mysterious places and towering dangers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve handcrafted, diorama-like environmental puzzles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden secrets and surprises off the beaten path<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face arcane threats with optional “skip combat” accessibility<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the epic and heartfelt tale of a hero who needs you<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtfully designed and lovingly crafted by a small team<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critically acclaimed with over 160 awards and nominations <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchestral soundtrack by acclaimed composer Jason Graves<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reimagined as the Definitive Adventure <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moss: The Forgotten Relic<\/i> brings <i>Moss <\/i>and <i>Moss: Book II<\/i> together as one complete, enhanced experience debuting on PC first time. New features include: <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 2 beloved and critically acclaimed experiences as one <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Visuals and Performance<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Handcrafted Cutscenes and Smart Follow Camera<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Twilight Garden DLC included <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Accessibility Option “Skip Combat”<\/